OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FGenerally cloudy to start
OL,6,FSunday with outbreaks of rain, perhaps
OL,7,Fheavy at first. Drier through the
OL,8,Fafternoon maybe with some brief bright
OL,9,Fspells developing. Light winds.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FCloud increasing overnight,
OL,12,Fwith showery rain arriving from the
OL,13,Fwest, this potentially heavy at times.
OL,14,FA rather mild night under the blanket
OL,15,Fof cloud.
OL,16,
OL,17,CMonday:FA cloudy day ahead with
OL,18,Foutbreaks of rain likely, becoming
OL,19,Fmore persistent and heavy later in the
OL,20,Fday. Moderate to fresh southwesterly
OL,21,Fwinds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
